{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_clustersharding", "label": "ClusterSharding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One actor per entity key spread over N nodes; cluster.sharding is a memoised facade returning the same ClusterSharding instance. Starting the same type twice on one node throws \u2014 the second call used to return the first's region, so a node wanting a hosting region silently got the proxy."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "label": "Shard region", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One per node. Routes to the owning shard and decides when local entities \u2014 and emptied shards \u2014 passivate, because only it sees traffic across all shards of the node (which is why maxEntities is a per-node cap)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_actor", "label": "Shard actor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Child of the region, owner of the entity actors; disappears once it has stood empty for its window and returns with the next message. Having a real path is what makes a shard addressable at all."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_actor", "label": "Entity actor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One per entityId, on the node currently owning the shard the id hashes into \u2014 like a singleton, but scaled to N entities."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_sharding_coordinator", "label": "Sharding coordinator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One per cluster, a singleton on the leader; decides shard ownership and handles rebalancing on membership change and on region shutdown."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shardkey", "label": "ShardKey", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identity is the typeName alone; the extractor rides along so the declaring class is the single source of truth, and a lookup-only node can name the same type without one. The explicit type argument is load-bearing: ShardKey.of('cart', ...) infers ShardKey<unknown> and every derived ref degrades to ActorRef<unknown>."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_extractentityid", "label": "extractEntityId", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pulls the routing key out of each message; an extractEntityId in the options overrides the one on the ShardKey."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_cluster_wide_agreement", "label": "numShards is a cluster-wide agreement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every node computes hash(entityId) % numShards itself, so two disagreeing nodes put the same id in different shards under paths that never collide \u2014 two live writers on one persistenceId. The value travels in the region's registration and the coordinator refuses a mismatching region; the refused region stays up and buffers forever, so the misconfiguration is a standstill with an error beside it rather than a silent split. A proxy node counts too."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "label": "Entity passivation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default idle window is 5 minutes; the region buffers messages arriving while the entity stops and replays them to the fresh incarnation, so nothing is lost. In-memory state does not survive it \u2014 a PersistentActor replays, a plain actor starts over."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "label": "Shard passivation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Passivating all entities used to leave the shard behind as a live actor holding an empty map; since ids scatter across the hash space, a long-running node eventually touched and kept every shard (64 idle empty actors at numShards = 64). The region keeps ownership so the shard stays routable and the next message recreates shard and entity together without a coordinator round trip. Only an empty shard is ever stopped."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_passivate", "label": "Passivate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries a stop message routed back to the entity so it decides exactly when and how it shuts down; PoisonPill terminates it as soon as it comes back."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_identity", "label": "Entity identity (this.entityId / this.entity)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The context is attached after the constructor, so a field initialiser throws \u2014 read the id in a getter or from preStart. Identity sits on the entity and nowhere else: a child gets None, so context.entity.nonEmpty answers 'am I the entity?'. Testing in isolation means handing the identity over via ActorOptions.withEntity instead of standing up a cluster."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_name_escaping", "label": "Injective entity-name escaping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actor names have a restricted alphabet, so a code unit outside [A-Za-z0-9_-.@:+] becomes ~ plus four hex digits. Injectivity is a correctness property, not a nicety: a shared name means the second entity starts under a taken name and the resulting error takes the whole shard down. The path is a label; entityId is the value, and nothing decodes a path segment."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shardingoptionstype", "label": "ShardingOptionsType", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five fields are also HOCON keys (number-of-shards, remember-entities, passivation-idle, shard-passivation-idle, max-entities), plus the coordinator keys rebalance-interval and hand-off-timeout; they set the node-wide baseline and sit below what start(...) passes explicitly."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_maxentities", "label": "maxEntities", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A per-node LRU cap rather than per-shard, because the region \u2014 not the shard \u2014 is what sees traffic across all shards of the node."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_clustersharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_actor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_actor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_actor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_sharding_coordinator", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_clustersharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shardkey", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shardkey", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_extractentityid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_cluster_wide_agreement", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_sharding_coordinator", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_passivate", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_actor", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_identity", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_actor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_name_escaping", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_identity", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shardingoptionstype", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_maxentities", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_maxentities", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_clustersharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shardingoptionstype", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_remember_entities_rememberentities", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_clustersharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_clustersingleton", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "sharding_four_actors", "label": "The four sharding actors", "nodes": ["docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_actor", "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_actor", "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_sharding_coordinator"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx"}]}